# Exact-path allowlist for scripts/check-postgres-only.sh.
#
# Format: <tracked path><TAB or spaces><reason>. Blank lines and # comments
# are ignored. Entries must name the exact file and state why the MySQL
# identifier is intentionally retained — broad path/regex exclusions are
# prohibited by the gate contract.
#
scripts/check-postgres-only.sh	The gate script itself defines the MySQL detection pattern.
.github/postgres-only.allowlist	Self-referential — entry format comments necessarily name MySQL.
